msgctxt "27\t89"
msgid "On to our next story..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "117\t373"
msgid ""
"A key figure in the liberal push for Okinawa\\n"
"military expansion, Defense Minister Ryuzo Tamiya,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "374\t579"
msgid ""
"and the man in charge of the Okinawa resort deal\\n"
"currently underway, Land Minister Yoshinobu Suzuki,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580\t697"
msgid "both paid a visit to the embattled region today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708\t974"
msgid ""
"On one side is Tamiya-san, a proponent of the island's\\n"
"newly proposed BMD, or ballistic missile defense system."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1009\t1199"
msgid ""
"While on the other is Suzuki-san, who has long opposed\\n"
"expansion of American military presence on Okinawan shores."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200\t1373"
msgid ""
"He suggests that the government instead focus its efforts\\n"
"on a new resort which will drive tourism to the region."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380\t1574"
msgid ""
"Political and business leaders alike are paying close\\n"
"attention to just what these two men's visits will entail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1594\t1757"
msgid ""
"Tamiya-san's journey got off to a rocky start as he\\n"
"was greeted at the airport by throngs of protesters..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1758\t1907"
msgid ""
"Carrying signs and handing out flyers opposing\\n"
"his proposed military expansion plans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1908\t2028"
msgid ""
"Suzuki-san, on the other hand, was met by\\n"
"a faction of local businessmen and financiers,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2029\t2192"
msgid ""
"who proceeded to take him on a personal guided tour\\n"
"of the intended site for his forthcoming resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2219\t2365"
msgid ""
"The two proposals, Tamiya-san's military expansion\\n"
"deal and Suzuki-san's plan for a new resort,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2366\t2485"
msgid ""
"have been met with mixed opinions from\\n"
"the people of Okinawa. Needless to say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2486\t2624"
msgid ""
"Both ministers will need to compromise\\n"
"if they hope to accomplish their goals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2639\t2835"
msgid ""
"Of course, it's clear that this BMD system is vital\\n"
"to ensuring Japan has a bright, stable future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2845\t3056"
msgid ""
"But I won't let us keep forcing Okinawa to sacrifice\\n"
"its own well-being for the country's defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3057\t3256"
msgid ""
"My resort development plan will help promote tourism\\n"
"to the island and dramatically stimulate its economy,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3257\t3452"
msgid ""
"thus creating new jobs and opportunities for the humble\\n"
"people of this beautiful land. I say, Okinawa first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3465\t3616"
msgid ""
"Defending our home is all that concerns me.\\n"
"I have nothing more to say on the matter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3617\t3747"
msgid ""
"As opposed to the seemingly\\n"
"more receptive Suzuki-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3750\t3918"
msgid ""
"Tamiya-san departed the airport clearly\\n"
"uninterested in entertaining interviews."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3929\t4183"
msgid ""
"The unannounced nature of the two ministers' visits\\n"
"has fueled speculation that both men will attempt to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4184\t4384"
msgid ""
"Push their respective proposals through the National Diet\\n"
"at some point in the coming weeks and months."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4385\t4482"
msgid "And what do the locals think of all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4507\t4593"
msgid ""
"We're crawling with\\n"
"American soldiers as is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4594\t4707"
msgid ""
"But a resort? Now that's something\\n"
"I might be able to get behind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4708\t4871"
msgid ""
"Even if someone does go and shoot missiles at us,\\n"
"I'd be willing to bet it'd be at Tokyo, not Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4872\t5012"
msgid ""
"Guess I'm not surprised Tamiya-san's not really\\n"
"thinkin' about what's best for us, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5061\t5332"
msgid ""
"As aspiring prime minister candidates, both men are\\n"
"likely to be under intense scrutiny for some time now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5367\t5434"
msgid "In other news..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5587\t5733"
msgid ""
"Uncle Kaz... Is that why they keep\\n"
"trying to kick us out?"
msgstr ""